      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T15:16:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If both those are equal, We should see the hit ratio to make a decision. \n\nWhy? If both are equal then it needs increasing.\n\n\u003e we cannot always increase due to storage limitations, we need to decide which ones to increase that offer higher improvement.\n\nThis is a more valid observation, I would prefer this to be used as justification of this change.",
